Cadence hosted runtime (@cadence/hosted-runtime)
================================================

This package contains code derived from the AgenticOS v2 tenant board,
distributed by its authors under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Upstream source: the agenticos-v2 repository, apps/api/src/tenant-board,
at the origin/staging baseline 136d0e5 used for the CAD-1850 extraction.
Derived files include the conversation base (session.ts), model transport
(tenant-model.ts), generation identity adapter (pi-identity.ts), transcript
projection (transcript.ts), event stream lifecycle (session-stream.ts),
bundled prompt/skill profile (skills.ts), board master payload (master.ts)
and the tool execution guard (tool-policy.ts).

